  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Contract for: Technology, Infrastructure and Urban Planning Centre (TI-UP) is a component of Technology, Infrastructure &amp; Urban Planning (TI-Up) Resource Centre reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;774,700. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Transport policy and administrative management, Energy policy and administrative management, Urban development and management, Mineral/mining policy and administrative management, Education facilities and training.</narrative>
  </description>
